    "link": "https://telluride-co.civicweb.net/Portal/MeetingInformation.aspx?Id=8050",
    "hasAgenda": true,
    "summary": "The August 6 retreat is a single three-hour work session in which Council will set the Town's goals and objectives for 2027. No votes, no land-use items — just the annual exercise of deciding what this Council wants to prioritize in the year ahead. Those priorities, once set, tend to shape budget decisions and staff direction for the whole cycle, so the conversation matters even if nothing is formally adopted.",
